/T (Outliers are detected using the IQR method: any value below Q1 - 1.5 x IQRorabove Q3 + 1.5 x IQR is treated as an outlier. It is applied to sale_price and market_price. The outliers are then replaced with the mean of the remaining \(non-outlier\) values. sale_price has 2,205 outliers \(upper limit Rs. 755\) and market_price has 2,147outliers \(upper limit Rs. 912.5\). The box plots below show the data before and after the treatment. )
